This project is an excercice for MAVK1 in HEAD, in programing course with Amaury Hamon using p5.js.

We where asked to code a design tool that is resulting in a small web site and pushing the deliverarise on Github.

This design tool purpose is to create with any type font a depth of filed extrusion with a mouse click on the canvas, onto a singular letter or glyph. 

To then be able to change the vertex and points color and export it for a riso impression.

The export can be in PNG, SVG, STL or OBJ.

This glyph can be used in any project, mainly designed for big prints.



